          "No portion of OSA's earnings shall, at any time, go toward the personal benefit of any member of OSA, member of the Executive Committee, member of the Governing Board, outside organization, volunteer, or private individual. Should OSA cease to exist, any and all assets shall first be applied toward any existing liabilities. Any remaining assets shall be donated to charitable organizations having objectives similar to those of OSA, subject to the approval of Voting Members by at least a simple majority of votes."
